    "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/w95H9VXLIJU?rel=0\u0026autoplay=1\u0026mute=1\u0026loop=1\u0026playlist=w95H9VXLIJU\u0026controls=0\u0026iv_load_policy=3\u0026fs=0\u0026disablekb=1\u0026playsinline=1\u0026t=10",
    "description": "An iconic private estate in the heart of the Golden Triangle.\nQuinta do Tesouro Almancil, set on an exceptional 5-hectare property, offers complete privacy, generous space and a rare lifestyle just minutes from Quinta do Lago and Vale do Lobo.\n \nA place where refined living, nature and discretion come together at the highest level.\n​\nWhere Prestige, Privacy and Lifestyle Come Together Yours to Own\nGuide Price €8,950,000\n\nIntroduction\nAn iconic private estate in the heart of the Golden Triangle. Quinta do Tesouro Almancil, set on an exceptional 5-hectare property, offers complete privacy, generous space and a rare lifestyle just minutes from Quinta do Lago and Vale do Lobo. A place where refined living, nature and discretion come together at the highest level. Renovation in 2026\n \nUltimate Privacy\nThe estate offers a level of privacy that is truly rare within the Golden Triangle. While most properties — even those priced between €10M and €20M — are set on relatively small plots, Quinta do Tesoura stands apart.\nWith three separate entrances and 5 hectares of land, you enjoy complete freedom and discretion, while still being close to beaches, restaurants and all amenities.\n \nThe Villa\nA long private driveway leads to the main residence, surrounded by landscaped gardens, olive trees and open countryside. The architecture blends Portuguese charm with modern comfort, featuring underfloor heating and air conditioning throughout.\n \nLiving Areas\nElegant yet welcoming. The living room with fireplace opens onto veranda and courtyard, while the dining room overlooks the pool and gardens.\n\nCourtyard\nA beautiful romantic shaded space, perfect during the summer months. At its heart stands an old olive tree, creating a natural focal point. The courtyard connects the living area with the studio, blending indoor and outdoor living effortlessly.\n \nKitchen\nFully equipped with high-end appliances and a practical utility room.\n \n4–5 Spacious Bedrooms\nFour luxurious en-suite bedrooms. The master suite features a large private terrace with sunset views.\n \nStudio\nFlexible space: cinema, gym, office, wellness or fifth bedroom.\n \nOutdoor Living\nBeautiful gardens, terraces, courtyard and pond. Fully irrigated with private borehole.\n \nHeated Pool \u0026amp; Jacuzzi\nHeated pool with heat pump, 6-person jacuzzi, outdoor shower and terraces with integrated sound system.\n \nGuesthouses / Guardhouses\nA separate entrance leads to two independent guesthouses, each with private parking. There are two units: a T2 and a T3. The T2 features an outdoor kitchen and outdoor shower, while the T3 offers a private swimming pool, cabana and spacious pool terrace, ideal for guests (Family) or staff.\n \nEquestrian Facilities \u0026amp; License\nProfessional stables, paddocks and arena 20x60 with Ebb \u0026amp; Flow system. Licensed for 15 horses.\n \nParking\nLarge garage + carport for three cars.\n \nSecurity\nFully fenced with CCTV and alarm.\n \nPrime Location\n12 minutes from Faro Airport\n13 minutes from Loulé Train Station (Lisbon \u0026amp; Porto)\n10 minutes from Nobel School\n14 minutes from beaches (Vale do Lobo, Quinta do Lago, Quarteira)\n4 minutes from MAR Shopping \u0026amp; IKEA\n11 minutes from Faro Private Hospital\n20 minutes from Vilamoura Equestrian Centre\n75 top restaurants nearby and close to 38 golf courses\n \nThe Golden Triangle\nThe Golden Triangle — including Quinta do Lago, Vale do Lobo and Almancil — is widely regarded as the most prestigious area in the Algarve. Known for its luxury lifestyle, world-class golf, fine dining and international community, it continues to attract high-end buyers from across Europe and beyond.\n \nInvestment \u0026amp; Development Potential\nThe Golden Triangle remains one of Europe’s strongest real estate markets.\n \nFor visionary buyers, this estate may offer interesting future possibilities, subject to applicable regulations and approvals. Its unique position outside the agricultural reserve creates potential for a boutique countryside concept or private retreat, integrated into the natural surroundings.\n \nIn short\nA rare opportunity to own a private estate with lifestyle, potential and absolute privacy in one of Europe’s most desirable locations.",
